OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmostly dying out this evening,
OL,7,Falthough a few continuing overnight
OL,8,Ffor Galloway. Otherwise a dry night
OL,9,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,10,Fclear periods. Light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMainly dry but rather cloudy
OL,13,Fin the morning with just a few light
OL,14,Fshowers, these mainly across the
OL,15,FSouthern Uplands. Becoming dry in the
OL,16,Fafternoon with prolonged sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
