OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright on Sunday. Cloudy with rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast on Monday.
OL,8,FGenerally becoming drier on Tuesday in
OL,9,Fthe southwest, but still with the
OL,10,Fchance of some showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
